            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-4 bg-light h-100 border">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger rounded-circle p-3 fs-5" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">1</span>
                        <h4 class="h5 m-0 fw-bold">Register as a Donor</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-secondary">
                        Fill out our secure donor registration form with your blood group, contact details, and location. Your data is strictly encrypted.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-4 bg-light h-100 border">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger rounded-circle p-3 fs-5" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">2</span>
                        <h4 class="h5 m-0 fw-bold">Hospitals Request Blood</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-secondary">
                        Hospitals and clinics submit urgent or routine blood requests specifying units and urgency level (Normal, Urgent, Emergency).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-4 bg-light h-100 border">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger rounded-circle p-3 fs-5" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">3</span>
                        <h4 class="h5 m-0 fw-bold">Verified Dispatch</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-secondary">
                        Administrators verify requests, atomically allocate verified blood units, and dispatch life-saving supplies with zero stock discrepancies.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ======================================================================
     EMERGENCY BLOOD REQUEST CTA BANNER
     ====================================================================== -->
<section class="section-pad" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A4162A 0%, #D62839 100%); color: #FFFFFF;">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <span class="badge bg-white text-danger px-3 py-2 fw-bold text-uppercase mb-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation me-1"></i> Immediate Medical Requirement?
        </span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold text-white mb-3">Facing an Emergency Blood Shortage?</h2>
        <p class="lead text-white-50 max-w-700 mx-auto mb-4" style="max-width: 650px;">
            Submit an emergency blood request immediately. Our 24/7 hospital coordination desk prioritizes emergency units for instant dispatch.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
            <a href="/request" class="btn btn-light btn-lg text-danger fw-bold shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-medical me-1"></i> Submit Emergency Request
            </a>
            <a href="tel:1800543337" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg fw-bold">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-phone me-1"></i> Call 24/7 Helpline
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

